  http://www.sis.pitt.edu/~ketil

DESCRIPTION

  Small utility to make screenborders black.  Makes your Workbench look
  better when using overscan mode.

  This package contains the source code.

  Running Blackborder twice will toggle the border on/off.

SPECIAL REQUIREMENTS

  OS 3.0 or higher.

AVAILABILITY

  ftp://ftp.wustl.edu/pub/aminet/util/boot/BlackborderSource.lha (3.589)

PRICE

  Free.

DISTRIBUTABILITY

  Freeware.
